    "content": "<h1>Minimalist Smart Watch</h1>\n<p>Matte black titanium casing with real-time biometric tracking, customizable bezel options, and 7-day battery life.</p>\n<h3>Key Specifications</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Display</strong>: 1.4-inch AMOLED Always-On Retina Display (454 x 454 resolution)</li>\n<li><strong>Battery Life</strong>: Up to 7 days continuous use on a single charge with fast magnetic induction charging</li>\n<li><strong>Biometric Sensors</strong>: Optical heart rate monitor, SpO2 blood oxygen, sleep stage tracking, and ECG</li>\n<li><strong>Durability</strong>: 5 ATM water resistance rated up to 50 meters, sapphire crystal glass lens</li>\n<li><strong>Connectivity</strong>: Bluetooth 5.3 Low Energy, NFC payments, and multi-satellite GPS</li>\n</ul>\n"
