    "content": "<h1>Studio ANC Headphones</h1>\n<p>Active noise cancelling wireless headphones engineered for deep focus and pristine audio.</p>\n<h3>Acoustic Architecture</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Drivers</strong>: Custom 45mm dynamic neodymium drivers tuned for studio-grade acoustic linearity</li>\n<li><strong>Noise Cancellation</strong>: Hybrid Active Noise Cancellation (ANC) with 4 external reference microphones</li>\n<li><strong>Transparency Mode</strong>: Instant ambient awareness toggle with voice enhancement algorithm</li>\n<li><strong>Battery Life</strong>: 40 hours with ANC activated; quick 10-minute charge gives 5 hours playback</li>\n<li><strong>Connectivity</strong>: Bluetooth 5.3 with LDAC, AAC, and SBC high-resolution audio codecs</li>\n</ul>\n"
